1
00:00:45,720 --> 00:00:49,483
=No.9 Hunter=

2
00:00:49,530 --> 00:00:51,323
=Episode 19=

3
00:01:12,280 --> 00:01:14,079
The Divine Stone belongs to me.

4
00:01:15,239 --> 00:01:16,439
You

5
00:01:17,680 --> 00:01:19,719
are mine as well.

6
00:01:33,359 --> 00:01:34,159
Chi Xiao.

7
00:01:34,760 --> 00:01:35,519
Chi...

8
00:01:35,719 --> 00:01:36,480
Chi Xiao?

9
00:01:37,959 --> 00:01:38,760
No.

10
00:01:39,239 --> 00:01:40,280
That is not Chi Xiao.

11
00:01:41,280 --> 00:01:44,159
He is Yu Linjun,
ruler of the Void Realm.

12
00:01:44,760 --> 00:01:46,599
Ruler of the Void Realm, so what?

13
00:01:47,560 --> 00:01:49,079
if you kneel and submit,

14
00:01:50,319 --> 00:01:51,120
I

15
00:01:52,599 --> 00:01:54,359
may spare your life.

16
00:01:56,760 --> 00:01:57,799
A mere mortal

17
00:01:58,599 --> 00:01:59,920
daring to wield our forbidden arts.

18
00:02:00,799 --> 00:02:02,239
Such flesh and blood,

19
00:02:03,040 --> 00:02:06,079
I truly cannot wait to taste it.

20
00:02:25,599 --> 00:02:28,319
You dared to kill my vessel

21
00:02:28,319 --> 00:02:30,319
that I sent to find the Stone
in the mortal world.

22
00:02:31,560 --> 00:02:33,280
You have no idea

23
00:02:33,280 --> 00:02:35,080
what you've brought upon yourself.

24
00:03:01,919 --> 00:03:03,319
Since you have come to me today,

25
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:05,520
I don't even need to hunt you down.

26
00:03:06,680 --> 00:03:07,919
For all those scores and grudges

27
00:03:08,879 --> 00:03:11,400
today, I will make you pay.

28
00:03:12,159 --> 00:03:15,159
If I could travel freely
to the mortal world,

29
00:03:18,159 --> 00:03:21,960
do you think I would have let you go?

30
00:03:30,919 --> 00:03:32,879
(I can't even touch her...)

31
00:03:33,479 --> 00:03:35,680
You seem stronger now.

32
00:03:38,520 --> 00:03:40,759
That only makes me want you more.

33
00:03:41,759 --> 00:03:45,479
I can't wait to taste you.

34
00:03:55,520 --> 00:03:57,080
Ziyan! Ziyan!

35
00:04:04,879 --> 00:04:05,680
Ziyan!

36
00:04:44,759 --> 00:04:47,480
Have you made your choice?

37
00:04:49,800 --> 00:04:50,920
Use the Wind God Chronicle

38
00:04:51,480 --> 00:04:53,000
and my life as the vessel

39
00:04:53,439 --> 00:04:55,399
to extract the Stone from her,

40
00:04:57,319 --> 00:04:58,720
and mend the sky with it.

41
00:04:59,800 --> 00:05:02,079
The Chronicle will stay within her.

42
00:05:02,720 --> 00:05:07,120
And no one will be able
to harm her again.

43
00:05:08,879 --> 00:05:09,839
For everything you have done,

44
00:05:10,920 --> 00:05:12,240
do you have any regrets?

45
00:05:15,879 --> 00:05:16,720
This time,

46
00:05:17,360 --> 00:05:18,839
you don't seem angry.

47
00:05:21,040 --> 00:05:22,199
Through all of this,

48
00:05:22,600 --> 00:05:24,439
I am glad it was you I met.

49
00:05:25,720 --> 00:05:26,800
Farewell.

50
00:05:28,040 --> 00:05:29,279
The road ahead...

51
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:31,079
you walk alone.

52
00:05:59,837 --> 00:06:00,630
Ziyan.

53
00:06:04,240 --> 00:06:05,040
Ziyan!

54
00:06:09,680 --> 00:06:10,480
Yuanchu.

55
00:06:11,759 --> 00:06:13,199
Ziyan is in danger.

56
00:06:13,199 --> 00:06:14,040
I have to go save her.

57
00:06:14,439 --> 00:06:14,959
Yuanchu.

58
00:06:14,959 --> 00:06:15,759
Ziyan is in danger.

59
00:06:16,319 --> 00:06:17,120
Yuanchu.

60
00:06:17,720 --> 00:06:19,120
You have been unconscious for days.

61
00:06:19,720 --> 00:06:21,160
The Void Realm has descended.

62
00:06:21,439 --> 00:06:22,720
The mortal world is in chaos.

63
00:06:24,120 --> 00:06:24,720
Demons rule.

64
00:06:24,720 --> 00:06:25,639
Humans suffer.

65
00:06:27,199 --> 00:06:29,199
You've lost the Wind God Chronicle,

66
00:06:30,240 --> 00:06:31,480
and your meridians are damaged.

67
00:06:32,560 --> 00:06:33,839
I can't let you risk yourself.

68
00:06:49,120 --> 00:06:50,120
The spell has faded.

69
00:06:50,319 --> 00:06:51,519
The connection is gone.

70
00:06:53,319 --> 00:06:54,800
Something must have happened to Ziyan.

71
00:06:56,480 --> 00:06:57,759
Ziyan,

72
00:07:00,839 --> 00:07:02,959
she is marrying Yu Linjun in three days.

73
00:07:08,079 --> 00:07:10,199
Yuanchu, she shielded you
in that barrier

74
00:07:10,199 --> 00:07:11,560
because she didn't want you to get hurt.

75
00:07:11,639 --> 00:07:12,560
Listen to me,

76
00:07:12,560 --> 00:07:13,600
heal your wounds first.

77
00:07:13,759 --> 00:07:15,480
Then I'll go with you
to crash that wedding.

78
00:07:22,639 --> 00:07:23,480
Senior...

79
00:07:23,920 --> 00:07:24,959
It is all right.

80
00:07:25,560 --> 00:07:26,879
My meridians are severed,

81
00:07:27,199 --> 00:07:28,639
I'll just have to rebuild them.

82
00:07:30,720 --> 00:07:31,519
Senior,

83
00:07:32,120 --> 00:07:33,759
Yuanzhen Sect is protected by a barrier.

84
00:07:34,600 --> 00:07:36,279
Demons cannot enter for now.

85
00:07:38,399 --> 00:07:39,680
You focus on your recovery.

86
00:07:45,079 --> 00:07:45,879
This time,

87
00:07:47,399 --> 00:07:49,160
I will not lose her again.

88
00:08:02,560 --> 00:08:03,360
Ziyan,

89
00:08:04,879 --> 00:08:05,800
you are awake.

90
00:08:10,560 --> 00:08:11,360
Lanxi!

91
00:08:15,279 --> 00:08:16,079
Lanxi!

92
00:08:16,879 --> 00:08:18,040
Is it really you?

93
00:08:20,319 --> 00:08:21,319
It is me.

94
00:08:22,560 --> 00:08:23,399
What is wrong?

95
00:08:26,199 --> 00:08:27,639
Did you have another nightmare?

96
00:08:30,920 --> 00:08:31,720
(It cannot be.)

97
00:08:32,399 --> 00:08:34,519
(My sister was killed by Yu Linjun...)

98
00:08:37,240 --> 00:08:38,799
(What is really going on?)

99
00:08:39,879 --> 00:08:41,519
(Why can't I remember anything?)

100
00:08:44,840 --> 00:08:46,360
Don't cry.

101
00:08:50,840 --> 00:08:53,080
Look! This is the gift you gave me.

102
00:08:53,080 --> 00:08:54,039
Do you still remember?

103
00:08:55,480 --> 00:08:58,600
You said it looked like a butterfly

104
00:08:59,159 --> 00:09:00,320
breaking free.

105
00:09:01,000 --> 00:09:02,559
You hoped we would be free like it.

106
00:09:06,759 --> 00:09:08,279
Put it on for me.

107
00:09:09,000 --> 00:09:10,360
Like you used to.

108
00:09:20,320 --> 00:09:21,240
Why are you crying?

109
00:09:22,759 --> 00:09:24,440
I'm right here.

110
00:09:25,960 --> 00:09:26,759
Lanxi.

111
00:09:27,679 --> 00:09:28,919
I missed you so much.

112
00:09:29,039 --> 00:09:31,240
I thought I had lost you forever.

113
00:09:34,480 --> 00:09:35,360
Silly girl.

114
00:09:36,240 --> 00:09:39,320
Yu Linjun brought me back.

115
00:09:40,519 --> 00:09:41,320
Yu Linjun?

116
00:09:42,159 --> 00:09:42,960
Mm.

117
00:09:45,960 --> 00:09:46,799
Here he comes.

118
00:09:55,919 --> 00:09:56,720
My Lord.

119
00:09:57,039 --> 00:09:57,840
Hm.

120
00:10:16,480 --> 00:10:19,840
The Demon Queen tried to kill me

121
00:10:19,840 --> 00:10:21,559
to avenge you.

122
00:10:23,320 --> 00:10:26,559
Now that your sister is alive again,

123
00:10:27,360 --> 00:10:29,759
I have given you two this reunion.

124
00:10:30,360 --> 00:10:32,600
All grievances between us are settled.

125
00:10:33,679 --> 00:10:37,200
So now, can you love me?

126
00:10:39,440 --> 00:10:40,240
Ridiculous.

127
00:10:40,879 --> 00:10:42,159
- Someone like you...
- Ziyan...

128
00:10:46,720 --> 00:10:47,919
My Lord and Ziyan

129
00:10:48,120 --> 00:10:49,919
are a perfect match.

130
00:10:54,159 --> 00:10:54,960
Lanxi.

131
00:11:00,159 --> 00:11:05,440
From now on, I will ensure you both
live in wealth and honor.

132
00:11:07,519 --> 00:11:09,159
Across both realms,

133
00:11:11,080 --> 00:11:16,559
only I will stand above you.

134
00:11:21,840 --> 00:11:22,639
(No matter.)

135
00:11:24,039 --> 00:11:26,759
(I will find a way to touch you)

136
00:11:27,720 --> 00:11:29,799
(and claim you.)

137
00:11:34,639 --> 00:11:37,759
(That crack looks just like
my Stone Curse mark.)

138
00:11:43,429 --> 00:11:49,016
(Lanruo Hall)

139
00:11:51,279 --> 00:11:52,759
He revived me for you.

140
00:11:53,000 --> 00:11:55,240
And now he has reopened
Lanruo Hall for you.

141
00:11:55,919 --> 00:11:57,679
I've never seen Yu Linjun

142
00:11:57,679 --> 00:11:59,120
care so much for any Saintess.

143
00:12:00,080 --> 00:12:01,960
You should cherish this.

144
00:12:04,679 --> 00:12:06,759
He has no heart.

145
00:12:07,720 --> 00:12:10,639
Lanxi, you used to hate him.

146
00:12:11,039 --> 00:12:12,919
How can you forgive him so easily?

147
00:12:14,360 --> 00:12:15,799
Has he bewitched you?

148
00:12:17,720 --> 00:12:18,919
I just think

149
00:12:19,440 --> 00:12:22,159
that living well matters most.

150
00:12:23,519 --> 00:12:26,279
Now we have his protection.

151
00:12:26,639 --> 00:12:28,399
We can finally live with dignity.

152
00:12:29,159 --> 00:12:30,879
No more fear and suffering.

153
00:12:31,440 --> 00:12:32,559
No more hardship.

154
00:12:33,720 --> 00:12:34,840
Isn't that good?

155
00:12:35,919 --> 00:12:37,879
Promise me, Ziyan,

156
00:12:39,240 --> 00:12:41,120
Stop fighting Yu Linjun.

157
00:12:42,679 --> 00:12:43,960
(Don't drink too much, now.)

158
00:12:44,960 --> 00:12:46,080
(Only you spoil me like this.)

159
00:12:46,080 --> 00:12:47,080
(Let's go upstairs.)

160
00:13:02,883 --> 00:13:06,811
♪I drink the rain of this mortal world,
and seek the path I chose♪

161
00:13:07,083 --> 00:13:10,256
♪How much sorrow and joy have I known?♪

162
00:13:10,297 --> 00:13:13,811
♪With this flesh and blood,
I chase the distant light♪

163
00:13:13,997 --> 00:13:16,931
♪Just to see clearly
the memories of this drifting life♪

164
00:13:17,211 --> 00:13:23,981
♪Let the wind sweep away
this heavy air of sorrow♪

165
00:13:24,627 --> 00:13:31,315
♪Do not forget the tangled paths
that you and I have crossed♪

166
00:13:32,221 --> 00:13:35,891
♪Let towering waves come crashing down;
I'll fight against the tide♪

167
00:13:36,001 --> 00:13:39,691
♪I shatter
the hollow fate they wrote for me♪

168
00:13:39,863 --> 00:13:46,097
♪With a heart free of regret,
I'll face the heavens and earth♪
